        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l l}{\\frac {d}{d t} [ a _ {1} y _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} y _ {2} (t) ] + a (t) [ a _ {1} y _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} y _ {2} (t) ] = \\frac {d}{d t} [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ]}&①\\\\{f _ {1} (t) \\rightarrow y _ {1} (t)}&{2 p \\quad \\frac {d y _ {1} (t)}{d t} + a (t) y _ {1} (t) = \\frac {d f _ {1} (t)}{d t}}\\\\&{\\frac {d y _ {2} (t)}{d t} + a (t) y _ {2} (t) = \\frac {d f _ {2} (t)}{d t}}\\\\&{③}\\end{array}\\right.\n$$",
