    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、LTIS的微积分性质",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            363,
            363,
            385
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于LTI系统满足如下的微分特性:若系统在激励 $e(t)$ 作用下产生响应 $r(t)$ ，则当激励为 $\\frac{de(t)}{dt}$ 时，响应为 $\\frac{dr(t)}{dt}$ 。根据线性与时不变性容易证明此结论。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            389,
            808,
            439
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "首先由时不变特性可知, 激励 $e\\left( t\\right)$ 对应输出 $r\\left( t\\right)$ , 则激励 $e\\left( {t - {\\Delta t}}\\right)$ 产生响应 $r\\left( {t -$ ${\\Delta t}}\\right)$ 。再由叠加性与均匀性可知,若激励为 $\\frac{e\\left( {t}\\right)  - e\\left( {t - {\\Delta t}}\\right) }{\\Delta t}$ 则响应等于 $\\frac{r\\left( t\\right)  - r\\left( {t - {\\Delta t}}\\right) }{\\Delta t}$ ,取 $t \\rightarrow$ 0 的极限,得到导数关系。若激励为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            444,
            823,
            513
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则响应为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            560,
            263,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/50392a17030dffaaaa0d0cc3cfc3eebaf87c3f89e03f8463fd9782f6e32702ff.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            374,
            492,
            842,
            618
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这表明，当系统的输入由原激励信号改为其导数时，输出也由原响应函数变成其导数。显然，此结论可扩展至高阶导数与积分。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            621,
            811,
            660
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
